 Summary
 Hardens the target entropy boundary used by the Cifra Hash_DRBG introduced in #61.
 Cifra Hash_DRBG remains the generator. It is initialized with 128 bytes from the selected backend, and generated bytes are XORed with fresh backend words. This PR makes backend selection fail closed, handles source failures safely, and documents the platform and serialization contracts.
